# https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/50871  (PR head 1fbe3b8b2e: topk_v2 for the relative prefill selection
# on gfx95, no switch)
# https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/51263  (PR head 68b2d4fcf3: one pipeline stage for relative prefill
# scoring on gfx95, no switch)
# Generated against the image's SGLang checkout (1ced9a9eb0) with patches 01-15 applied; source files only (tests dropped).
# Differs from the PRs: both behind the opt-in SGLANG_AMD_QSA_PREFILL_TOPK_V2=1 (fast_topk on scaled scores and three
# stages unless set); in batch-invariant mode the selection keeps fast_topk, where sgl-project/sglang#50871 runs
# topk_v2 in its deterministic mode.
# Apply in /sgl-workspace/sglang with git apply.

